	<string id="st_fr_note_mastery">
		<text>You know this beast inside out and every strike counts.</text>
	</string>

	<string id="st_fr_mon_tushkano">
		<text>Tushkano</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_tushkano_1">
		<text>They attack in packs, fast and low. Keep your back to a wall.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_tushkano_2">
		<text>Flimsy: a knife or a single shot is enough. Do not waste expensive ammo on them.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_mon_flesh">
		<text>Flesh</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_flesh_1">
		<text>Clumsy, but up close it knocks you down with a ramming blow.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_flesh_2">
		<text>Do not let it get close: a couple of shots from range beat a brawl.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_mon_dog">
		<text>Blind dog</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_dog_1">
		<text>They hunt in packs and try to surround their prey.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_dog_2">
		<text>After losing part of the pack the dogs often flee. Shoot the closest ones.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_mon_boar">
		<text>Boar</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_boar_1">
		<text>Charges in a straight line. Step aside at the last moment.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_boar_2">
		<text>Shoot while it turns around after a miss: that is when it is exposed.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_mon_pseudodog">
		<text>Pseudodog</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_pseudodog_1">
		<text>Stronger and tougher than a blind dog, it often leads the pack.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_pseudodog_2">
		<text>It attacks with a leap: step aside and hit it as it lands.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_mon_psy_dog">
		<text>Psy-dog</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_psy_dog_1">
		<text>Creates phantom copies that distract and wound.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_psy_dog_2">
		<text>Find the real one: when it dies, the phantoms vanish.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_mon_snork">
		<text>Snork</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_snork_1">
		<text>Moves on all fours and attacks with long leaps.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_snork_2">
		<text>Defenseless mid-leap: meet it with a shotgun as it lands.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_mon_bloodsucker">
		<text>Bloodsucker</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_bloodsucker_1">
		<text>Turns invisible. Its breathing and shimmering air give it away.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_bloodsucker_2">
		<text>It shows itself for a moment after striking: fire at once, a shotgun works best.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_mon_poltergeist">
		<text>Poltergeist</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_poltergeist_1">
		<text>Invisible and throws objects; the fire poltergeist sets everything ablaze.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_poltergeist_2">
		<text>Aim at the glowing core and stay away from heavy objects.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_mon_controller">
		<text>Controller</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_controller_1">
		<text>Attacks your mind while it can see you. Do not linger in the open.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_controller_2">
		<text>Close in while breaking line of sight with cover: up close it is vulnerable.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_mon_burer">
		<text>Burer</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_burer_1">
		<text>Throws objects with telekinesis and can wrench the weapon from your hands.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_burer_2">
		<text>It hides behind a shield: wait until it drops it, then strike point-blank.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_mon_chimera">
		<text>Chimera</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_chimera_1">
		<text>Huge leaps and crushing blows; it hunts mostly at night.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_chimera_2">
		<text>Bring a large caliber and plenty of ammo. Obstacles break its leaps.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_mon_gigant">
		<text>Pseudogiant</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_gigant_1">
		<text>Its ground stomp sends out a wave that knocks you off your feet.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_fr_note_gigant_2">
		<text>Keep your distance and use your most powerful weapons and grenades.</text>
	</string>
